  "components": [
    {
      "name": "RentFlow RF Roofline Mark",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "rentflow-mark",
      "description": "Compact geometric RF and roofline mark used beside the RentFlow wordmark.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-brand\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"RentFlow\"><svg class=\"ds-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-roof\" d=\"M4.5 13.8 20 4.8l15.5 9\"/><path class=\"ds-letter\" d=\"M9 34.5v-18h8.8c5.2 0 5.5 8.2-.1 8.2H9m7.4 0 5.9 9.8\"/><path class=\"ds-letter\" d=\"M26.5 34.5v-18H34m-7.5 7.9H33\"/></svg><span>RentFlow</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#F3F6FC;font:700 17px/1 RentFlowDisplay,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.35px}.ds-mark{width:42px;height:42px;overflow:visible}.ds-roof,.ds-letter{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-width:2.8}.ds-roof{stroke:#3687FF}.ds-letter{stroke:#FFFFFF}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dark Auth Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "auth-panel-dark",
      "description": "Navy sheet overlapping the apartment photo with a broad upper radius.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-auth-panel\"><h2>Đăng nhập</h2><p>Quản lý nhà trọ của bạn dễ dàng hơn.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-auth-panel{padding:16px 23px 8px;background:#07111F;color:#F3F6FC;border:1px solid #223247;border-bottom:0;border-radius:32px 32px 0 0}.ds-auth-panel h2{margin:0 0 8px;font:700 20px/1.25 system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-auth-panel p{margin:0;color:#9AACC2;font:400 16px/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mode Tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "mode-tabs",
      "description": "Two-way sign-in and registration selector with a single moving blue indicator.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\" aria-label=\"Tài khoản\"><button class=\"ds-tab ds-active\" aria-current=\"page\">Đăng nhập</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Đăng ký</button><span class=\"ds-indicator\"></span></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{position:relative;display:flex;height:50px;border-bottom:1px solid #1B2A3D}.ds-tab{flex:1;border:0;background:transparent;color:#9AACC2;padding:8px 12px;font:600 16px system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-tab.ds-active{color:#F3F6FC}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3687FF;outline-offset:-3px;border-radius:8px}.ds-indicator{position:absolute;bottom:-1px;left:0;width:50%;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:#155FC0;transition:transform 220ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dark Auth Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "auth-field-dark",
      "description": "Outlined email or password field with a dark fill and blue focus state.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6h18v12H3zM3 7l9 7 9-7\"/></svg><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Email hoặc số điện thoại\" aria-label=\"Email hoặc số điện thoại\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;min-height:56px;padding:0 15px;border:1px solid #1B2A3D;border-radius:15px;background:#0B1726;color:#F3F6FC}.ds-field:focus-within{border-color:#155FC0;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #155FC0}.ds-field svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:#9AACC2;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-field input{min-width:0;flex:1;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;color:#F3F6FC;font:400 16px system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-field input::placeholder{color:#9AACC2;opacity:1}.ds-field:focus-within input::placeholder{opacity:.8}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Light Auth Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "auth-field-light",
      "description": "Light-mode counterpart with the same rounded outline and focus treatment.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-light\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6h18v12H3zM3 7l9 7 9-7\"/></svg><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Email hoặc số điện thoại\" aria-label=\"Email hoặc số điện thoại\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field-light{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;min-height:56px;padding:0 15px;border:1px solid #E2E8F0;border-radius:15px;background:#F7F9FC;color:#14263C}.ds-field-light:focus-within{border-color:#155FC0;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #155FC0}.ds-field-light svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:#62748A;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-field-light input{min-width:0;flex:1;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;color:#14263C;font:400 16px system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-field-light input::placeholder{color:#62748A;opacity:1}.ds-field-light:focus-within input::placeholder{opacity:.8}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary Sign-in Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Full-width blue gradient action for sign-in or registration.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary-button\"><span>Đăng nhập</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary-button{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;width:100%;height:54px;border:0;border-radius:15px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1F6FF0,#145BD1);color:#FFFFFF;font:700 16px system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:filter 180ms ease,transform 180ms ease}.ds-primary-button:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}.ds-primary-button:active{transform:scale(.99)}.ds-primary-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3687FF;outline-offset:3px}.ds-primary-button svg{width:19px;height:19px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Unavailable Provider",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "provider-unavailable-dark",
      "description": "Muted, disabled provider action with explicit setup status.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-provider\" disabled aria-label=\"Google, Chưa cấu hình\"><span class=\"ds-google\" aria-hidden=\"true\">G</span><span class=\"ds-provider-copy\"><strong>Google</strong><small>Chưa cấu hình</small></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-provider{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:54px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #1B2A3D;border-radius:14px;background:#0B1726;color:#9AACC2;font:600 14px system-ui,sans-serif;opacity:1}.ds-provider:disabled{cursor:not-allowed}.ds-google{color:#9AACC2;font:700 18px system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-provider-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:2px}.ds-provider-copy small{font-size:12px;font-weight:400}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Light Unavailable Provider",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "provider-unavailable-light",
      "description": "Light-mode disabled provider state with readable supporting status.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-provider-light\" disabled aria-label=\"Số điện thoại, Chưa cấu hình\"><span class=\"ds-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"6.5\" y=\"2.5\" width=\"11\" height=\"19\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M10 5h4m-2 13h.01\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-provider-copy\"><strong>Số điện thoại</strong><small>Chưa cấu hình</small></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-provider-light{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:54px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E2E8F0;border-radius:14px;background:#F7F9FC;color:#62748A;font:600 14px system-ui,sans-serif;opacity:1}.ds-provider-light:disabled{cursor:not-allowed}.ds-phone svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-provider-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:2px}.ds-provider-copy small{font-size:12px;font-weight:400}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Night-Lit Welcome",
    "overview": "The login screen pairs a quiet apartment-at-night photograph and warm window light with a restrained navy form surface. The screen starts in dark mode; a deliberate theme control exposes the supported light palette. The user-pinned direction is: “Dark Premium. Modern Real Estate SaaS. Giao diện Flutter Mobile. Bám sát bố cục hình tham chiếu thứ hai. Sang trọng, tối giản, hiện đại.”\n\nThe photo and compact custom-painted RF roofline mark establish RentFlow; the form stays the clearest, most legible part of the screen. The RF roofline mark is RentFlow's first-party brand mark, drawn in Flutter code rather than borrowed from an icon package. The supplied Vietnamese supporting line remains “Quản lý nhà trọ của bạn dễ dàng hơn.”",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Night facade, warm residential light, and a deep navy overlapping panel.",
      "One precise blue family for selection, focus, links, and the primary action.",
      "Platform-native controls and honest service feedback."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Single Blue Rule",
        "body": "Keep blue tied to interactive meaning; do not add a second decorative accent.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The System Role Rule",
        "body": "Keep form labels and entered text in adaptive platform roles; reserve RentFlowDisplay for brand display moments.",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the supplied Vietnamese supporting line and the pinned Dark Premium direction.",
      "Do keep all touch targets at least 48 logical px and preserve the scrollable form above the keyboard.",
      "Do keep provider status and unavailable-auth feedback truthful until a provider is configured."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add decorative shadows, extra accent colors, or a replacement logo asset.",
      "Don't style provider options as active or imply that sign-in, registration, phone, Google, or recovery is connected."
    ]
  }
}
